添加单个服务，服务名字为test，tcp目的端口为22，源端口为0-65535
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/services
{
"servType": "USRDEF_SERV",
"name": "test",
"tcpEntrys": [
{
"dstPorts": [
{
"start": 22
}
],
"srcPorts": [
{
"start": 0,
"end": 65535
}
]
}
],
"description": ""
}

